<figure class="exhibit" data-exhibit="mentormatch" data-src="/data/mentormatch.json" id="fig-03">
  <div class="exhibit__bar">
    <span class="mono"><strong>Fig. 03</strong> · stable matching round</span>
    <span class="ticks" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <span class="mono">synthetic preferences</span>
  </div>

  <div class="ctl-row">
    <button class="btn btn--red" type="button" data-run-match>Run a matching round ▸</button>
    <span class="mono" data-match-status aria-live="polite"></span>
    <noscript><p class="mono">Interactive exhibit requires JavaScript.</p></noscript>
  </div>

  <svg data-match-svg viewBox="0 0 560 170" role="img"
    aria-label="Animated matching round between three mentors and three mentees"
    style="margin-top: 0.6rem"></svg>

  <figcaption class="figcap mono">
    Mentors propose, mentees hold their best offer, and displaced mentors try
    again until the matching is stable. The animation plays one full round of
    the algorithm. Names and preferences here are synthetic.
  </figcaption>
</figure>
